    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": " Presented in good condition throughout, this bright and spacious two-bedroom third-floor apartment is ideally located within the popular Marketpoint development in the heart of Mullingar. Offering comfortable modern living with scenic canal views, this superb apartment is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a quality property in a prime town centre location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with useful storage, leading to a spacious open-plan living and dining area with an electric fireplace and direct access to a private balcony overlooking the canal. The adjoining fitted kitchen is equipped with an excellent range of units, integrated oven, electric hob and plumbing for a washing machine. There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both enjoying attractive views towards the canal and benefiting from storage heating. The principal bedroom is complemented by a fully tiled en-suite with Mira power shower, while the main bathroom is fitted with a three-piece suite including a bath.\n\nMarketpoint is a mature and professionally managed development, offering residents ample parking and beautifully maintained communal areas. Ideally positioned just a short stroll from Mullingar town centre, the apartment is within walking distance of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and a host of everyday amenities. Mullingar Train Station and the C-Link Road are also nearby, providing excellent connectivity for commuters.\n\nCombining an unbeatable town centre location and attractive canal views, this excellent apartment presents an outstanding opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 1.9m x 3.29m (6'3\" x 10'10\"): \nWood flooring, storage. \n\nKitchen/Living Area \n5.57m x 4.73m (18'3\" x 15'6\") & \n0.65m x 1.08m (2'2\" x 3'7\"): \nWood flooring, fitted kitchen units, integrated oven, electric hob, extractor, plumbed for washing machine, electric fire, balcony, storage heating. \n\nStorage Closet 1.1m x 0.99m (3'7\" x 3'3\"): \nShelving, timber floor. \n\nBedroom One 2.54m x 4.08m (8'4\" x 13'5\"): \nWood flooring, storage heater, panoramic canal view. \n\nBedroom Two 2.75m x 4.63m (9' x 15'2\"): \nWood flooring, storage heating, Canal scenery view. \n\nEn-Suite 2.57m x 1.64m (8'5\" x 5'5\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, shower cubicle with Mira power shower, part tiled wall, wall mounted mirror and light.\n\nBathroom 2.22m x 2.01m (7'3\" x 6'7\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, bath, wall mounted mirror and light. \n\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•Third floor 2-bed apartment\n•Scenic views\n•Balcony\n•Ideal starter property\n•5 minutes to town centre\n•Close to all amenities\n•5 min to Train station\n•ample parking\n•Good condition throughout\n•Storage heating\n"
      },
